/// others its workers - instead of the 8 x 8 tile; and, on a frame whose count is past the path's bound L, DENSE: one
/// lane a listed texel with the tile pass's batch, deal and allowance (main(), compactDense).
layout( constant_id = 0 ) const bool kCompactPass = false;
